{% extends "layouts/app-layout.njk" %}

{% set pageTitle = "AI and digital services" %}
{% set pageDescription = "This guidance explains how digital teams can use artificial intelligence (AI) responsibly." %}
{% set pageSection = "AI and digital services" %}
{% set landingPage = true %}
{% set dateUpdated = "September 2026" %}

{% block bodyContent %}

<p>This guidance applies to digital teams who work on NHS digital services, including contractors and agency staff.</p>
<p>It explains how to use AI in digital services. It will also help you understand the principles around using it in your day-to-day work in digital teams, for example to analyse data, prototype and build services and streamline workflows.</p>

<p>This guidance will help your team to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>learn and maintain AI literacy</li>
  <li>be more creative and efficient</li>
  <li>stay ethical, safe and inclusive</li>
  <li>meet the standards in the service manual</li>
</ul>
<p>It does not tell you how to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>develop production code <code>it probably should</code></li>
  <li>use agentic AI for user research <code>what does this mean?</code></li>
  <li>use AI as a tool for wider design practice, for example for service design or creating design artefacts <code>what do we mean by artifacts?</code></li>
</ul>

